    "Aliases invoke entire owner workflows; never create alias artifacts.",
    "CP-1A is required before default core synthesis under the adopted user request.",
    "CP-3 requires CP-2; CP-5 precedes CP-6. Final integrity validation is separate.",
    "Do not copy inconsistent FULL/LITE membership lists; derive membership from the 25 physical owners.",
    "CP-DR standalone mode requires its complete research brief rather than manufactured CP-0.",
    "CP-L10 default product intake uses CP-0; record the source header/catalog discrepancy.",
    "Portfolio Fit is retained as a report responsibility; it is not a 26th r14 physical package.",
    "CP-OS is present in the manifest but not catalog modules; its scope comes from its SKILL.md.",
    "CP-MODEL publishes the HTML Model destination and the calculation JSON of accepted CP-1 (decision 0006 DC-5); the r14 XLSX workbook export is deferred.",
    "Statuses have two scopes: a row here describes the module as a whole; a journal Head.qualification describes one promoted artifact."
